# Bash's clients talk to backend-core's server: api.joinedhq.com/bash/... in production
# builds, the local one (`bun run dev:core-api`, see backend-core/.env.example) in
# development builds. Put overrides in extension/.env or ui-board/.env:
# VITE_BASH_API_URL=https://api.joinedhq.com
# VITE_JOINED_URL=https://joinedhq.com
